WEBVTT

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:16.080
In this world, there are many mages.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.700
Even if they are all called mages,

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:23.370
there are the novices who
can only do simple magic,

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:24.740
the apprentice witches,

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:29.290
and the full witches, who are at the top.

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:32.660
Who is the beautiful girl wearing
a brooch that signals her status as a witch,

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:37.830
whose ashen hair flutters in the wind,
shining so much with beauty and talent

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:43.990
that even the sun's eyes squint involuntarily?

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:46.790
That's right, it's me.

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:27.990
The Land of Mages

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:36.370
Welcome to the Land of Mages.

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:39.240
Please, come in, Madam Witch.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:41.450
You don't need to check anything?

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:46.330
No, since only mages can
get here in the first place,

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:50.740
and that brooch is proof that
you're a witch, Madam Ashen Witch.

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:53.870
I see. Thank you.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:03:00.660
As you might guess from the name,
only mages can enter the Land of Mages,

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:03.870
so I heard that witches, as the highest
ranking mages, are especially respected

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:09.790
and are looked upon with
envious gazes and fawned over.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:14.410
I've been looking forward
to visiting this country.

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:23.240
Flying in the sky is recommended, it looks like?

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:33.540
It's a very elegant city.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:36.950
Now, first, I'll look for a place to--

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:39.620
No...!

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:54.620
Ow...

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:56.700
What's with this girl?

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:00.870
Um, are you all right?

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:02.830
Oh, um, um, um...

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:04.620
Wh-What should I do?

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:07.160
I can't fix this many roof tiles...!

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:09.790
Don't you think you should apologize first?

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:13.370
Oh, I'm sorry! I'm so, so sorry!

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:14.910
Are you all right?

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:18.370
I'm fine, but what about you?

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:19.830
Huh?

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:24.830
Oh, I'm fine.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:28.080
As you can see, I'm fit as a fiddle!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.450
Here.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:34.700
But...

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:39.120
I'll fix the roof tiles, so please rest a bit.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:40.870
No, I'll help, too!

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:41.830
It's fine.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:42.700
But--

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:44.330
It's fine.

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:46.740
Right...

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:49.080
Ow...

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:15.450
A time-reversing spell!

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:16.540
All fixed.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.450
Wow!

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:20.240
You're next.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:21.330
Huh?

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:35.200
Wow, I'm healed!

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.620
Amazing...

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:38.950
Being able to do this
much is normal for a witch.

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:39.910
Goodbye.

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:41.580
U-Um...!

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:45.830
Make sure you check your
surroundings when you're flying.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.450
P-P-Please, wait.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.950
Madam Witch, is there
anything I can do to apologize?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:54.080
Well, take care of yourself,
mage-whose-name-I-do-not-know.

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:02.200
Now, to find a place to stay...

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:06.120
Oh, that place looks splendid and fine.

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:10.660
What if they're like,
"Madam Witch, no payment is necessary.

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:13.290
Please, won't you grace us with your presence?"

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.200
What to do?

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:19.540
Please, leave.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:22.290
You cannot stay here.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:25.410
Huh?

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:31.660
Miss, I'm sorry, but please find
a place more suitable for you to stay at.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.790
What?

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.870
What's this...?

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.950
What's going on?

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:40.660
Far from being fawned over,

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:44.080
I've been getting kicked out
of every place I've tried.

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:45.790
This is the last place.

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:48.160
It doesn't look like there
are any other hotels around.

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:50.990
A run-down place like
this should take me, right?

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:53.580
It should, right...?

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:15.240
W-Welcome...?

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.540
You're the witch from earlier! I-I'm sorry!

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:20.410
Are you here for retribution?

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.830
You are, aren't you?

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:22.660
I'm sorry!

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:25.950
Please, just spare my life...
just spare my life...

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:25.950
Um...

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:30.410
A-Are you going to tear off
everything below my shoulder?

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:35.410
No...!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:35.410
I'm just looking for a place to stay.

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:36.910
Huh?

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:39.410
Oh, is that it?

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:42.740
You saved me the trouble
of going to look for you.

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:45.620
Please enter your name in the register.

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:48.240
I really am sorry about earlier.

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:52.660
Miss Elaina, I wanted to thank you properly.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.370
"Miss Elaina"?

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:56.620
Oh, it's right there.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:57.910
I see.

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:00.740
Um, my name's Saya.

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:03.330
Is there anything I can do to thank you?

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.160
Well...

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:09.950
It'd be great if you could give me more
than just the normal witch's discount.

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:11.990
Yes, of course!

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:17.080
Then, I'll take your things
to your room. Here's the key...

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:17.080
Huh?

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:20.040
It's gone... gone...

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.700
Gone, gone...

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:23.200
Gone...

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:26.200
I can't believe I lost my brooch...

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:29.330
That's why the other places
not only didn't fawn over me,

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:32.740
but they also treated me coldly.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.870
Miss Elaina!

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:37.740
I don't see it here, either!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:41.450
We've looked so much,
but we still can't find it...

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:51.290
Miss Fran...

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:53.490
What have I done?

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:57.370
I can't believe I lost something so important...

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:04.410
What are you doing in my room?

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:07.790
I have a favor to ask, so I was waiting for you.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:11.120
I thought I'd locked the door, though...

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:16.160
Heh, you forget that I work here.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:21.620
Just what do you think you're doing,
coming into my room without permission?!

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.200
Huh?!

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:27.370
Meanie...

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.660
Well? What was the favor?

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:32.370
Oh, right!

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:39.580
Madam Witch, please teach me what I need
to know to pass the apprentice witch exams!

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:43.790
Um, what's with that pose you've been doing?

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:48.040
This is a traditional way of prostrating
yourself from my country called " <i>dogeza</i> ."

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:49.740
" <i>Dogeza</i> "?

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:52.080
That's a strange tradition.

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:55.660
But it does feel sincere.

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:58.290
Anyway, tell me about your situation.

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:00.620
Right!

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:03.290
I have a little sister.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.700
She's the cute girl in the picture!

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:06.740
I see...

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:09.950
We're from a land in the east.

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:14.830
We came together from afar
to become apprentice witches...

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:16.330
From afar...

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:21.790
We worked at this hotel to save up money
as we took the exams over and over...

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:27.120
So the two of you are still
novices after all this time?

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:29.740
Is your sister out right now?

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:35.620
She passed the last exams
and went back home first...

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:39.660
So you panicked because your
dear little sister got ahead of you,

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:43.660
so you thought you'd ask a witch
you happened to meet for help.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.040
Is that it?

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.790
Well... I suppose that's how it turned out...

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:52.240
When's the next test?

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:53.740
In one week...

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:55.990
A week...

00:10:55.990 --> 00:11:02.660
Well, I can teach you until
I find my brooch, at least.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.410
Thank you very much!

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:07.540
Thank you! Thank you!

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:12.540
And so, I became Saya's teacher.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.200
"Teacher"...

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:16.910
It has an unexpectedly nice ring to it.

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:20.830
In order for a novice to
become an apprentice witch,

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:24.620
she must first pass a written exam.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:29.330
I hate to say it, but you can pass
the written test with a night of cramming.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:33.120
The problem is the second test--the magic test.

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:38.120
You have to keep flying on your
broom and exchange nonlethal attacks,

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:41.410
and only the one who wins in the end can pass.

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:44.700
She then officially becomes an apprentice witch.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:48.240
I never want to take a test like that again.

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:51.120
Let me give it to you straight, Saya.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:53.240
With your current abilities,

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:56.700
the likelihood of you passing
the magic test is close to zero.

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:59.950
Don't give it to me so straight!

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:02.830
But since it's "close to zero,"

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:05.040
it's not zero.

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.790
So you're saying it's possible?

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:13.620
First, you need to be able to maneuver
your broom as well as or better than me.

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:17.450
What? That's pretty tough...

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:19.290
Please don't act so spoiled.

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:21.540
Do you want it to end with you
getting knocked off your broom

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:24.830
right after the exam starts?

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:29.450
Next is turning.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:33.120
Shift your weight and turn adroitly.

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:34.490
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:38.620
Next are sudden breaks and starts.

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:41.330
After forcing the broom to
a stop with your whole body,

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:44.120
pretend you're kicking
the air and shoot back up.

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:45.740
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.910
Next is breaking away in midair.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:55.580
After letting go of your broom in midair,

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:58.410
use magic to call it back to you.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:04.540
If it looks like you're in danger,

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:08.330
I'll go help you, so you can fly without worry.

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:10.120
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:24.330
Saya was able to fly about
as well as me in no time.

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:26.330
You can do it after all...

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:32.490
This must be how a mother feels
when she's teaching her child to fly.

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:33.790
But,

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.410
to be able to do it so quickly...

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:40.620
What has she been doing up until now?

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:43.870
You practiced hard today, too, huh?

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:47.240
Well then, let's eat.

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:53.410
This is good.

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:55.410
I'm glad!

00:13:56.870 --> 00:14:00.620
I-I didn't think it'd be mixed in...

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:02.990
You don't like mushrooms?

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:06.540
I <i>hate</i> them! I mean, they grow from trees!

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:09.040
Which means, they're <i>trees</i> !

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:12.620
I am <i>not</i> in the habit of eating trees!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:15.830
If you're a picky eater,
you can't become a witch.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:16.910
Huh?!

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:19.740
If you want to become an apprentice witch,

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:24.870
you must have the ability to
endure eating even foods you don't like.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:26.160
Seriously?

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:27.410
Seriously.

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:31.450
So think of this as training and eat them all.

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:37.080
I'm in hell...

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:56.740
Now, I'll use wind magic to
make the fruit from that tree drop.

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.240
Please try it.

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:02.620
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:11.410
You must be able to use attack magic precisely.

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:15.700
This is an actual, slightly
underhanded--I mean, clever--

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:18.790
trick I used in the actual magic exams.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:21.490
Use wind magic to change the flow of the air

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:24.410
and block the way of the other examinees.

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:26.410
It's unexpectedly effective.

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:28.790
I see! Just what I'd expect
from you, Miss Elaina!

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:32.990
I don't know what you were
expecting, but try it again.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:34.580
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.490
To master it, you need your body
to remember how to do it.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:46.540
M-My body...?

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:50.040
Like this. Gently, softly...

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:53.200
P-Please be kind to me...

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.910
Okay, here we go.

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:58.200
Wind magic!

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:02.700
Why...?

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:04.450
And so, for the next few days,

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:10.330
I searched for my brooch
in between Saya's training.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:18.830
It's really nowhere to be found...

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:27.330
I saw your witch's brooch.

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:28.990
Where did you see it?

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:31.990
Please tell me, lovely lady.

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:35.200
I've been forgetting things a lot recently...

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:38.620
Oh? Look what I found...

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:42.370
Oh! I remember now! I remember--

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:45.080
This is what I saw...

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:56.040
Come in.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:58.120
Um, Miss Elaina...

00:16:58.120 --> 00:16:59.700
What is it?

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:03.370
C-Can I sleep with you?

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:05.120
There's not much space.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.490
Sorry this is such a cheap place.

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:10.080
That's not what I meant...

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:13.490
Anyway, you can if you want.

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:15.290
Yay!

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:29.290
You've improved a lot, haven't you?

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:32.950
You don't need my help anymore.

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:35.620
Huh? No, that's not true.

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:40.740
I still have a lot of things
I want you to teach me.

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:43.080
I'm a traveler.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.540
I'll be leaving this country soon.

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:50.120
But until then, we'll always be together.

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:55.740
Please teach me a lot more,

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:57.830
about a lot of things.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:02.830
You're asking for too much, Saya.

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:03.950
Huh?

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:07.580
Will you please return my brooch?

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.830
You improved too fast.

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:14.830
I thought it was because I was good at teaching,

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:16.700
but that wasn't the case.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:20.580
You were able to ride
a broom properly from the start.

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:23.580
You came from a faraway land, didn't you?

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:27.660
If you were bad at flying,
then how did you get here?

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:33.910
Yes, when I heard what the
woman said, everything made sense.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:36.080
You...

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:45.490
All right!

00:18:58.290 --> 00:19:03.910
You can't tie someone down
using misguided methods like this.

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.790
I was lonely...

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:14.620
I'm not your little sister, you know.

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:17.040
I know that.

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:18.990
But...

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:23.290
I wanted to be together with someone.

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.870
I hated being alone so much...

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:27.740
I was scared...

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:30.490
That's why I--Ouch!

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:32.200
What are you doing?!

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:34.620
That's not a good reason.

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:37.580
When you are seriously
trying to accomplish something,

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:39.870
you will always be alone.

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:42.910
You can't do it if you're not alone.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.120
Once you start being friendly, it's over.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.620
It's hard to fight alone, isn't it?

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.240
It's scary, right?

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:53.660
I know that, too.

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:55.410
That's why...

00:19:58.040 --> 00:19:59.240
This is...

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.450
You may have it.

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:01.540
What?

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:03.830
So that you'll be fine even if you're alone,

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:07.950
please allow me to leave
a part of me by your side.

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:10.700
But, this is yours...

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:12.700
It's fine.

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:16.830
That's my spare.

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:19.490
Now, we match.

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:22.370
After this, you will be by yourself.

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:25.740
But, you will not be alone.

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:32.120
People like your sister and me
are all watching over you.

00:20:34.990 --> 00:20:39.490
I'll pay for your whole hotel stay...

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:42.120
...out of my own wages.

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:45.830
If I don't have enough,
I'll pay in installments...

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:58.620
And so, we spent our last night together.

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:01.120
I soothed the sobbing girl,

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:04.830
and taught her ways to make
it through the magic exams.

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:07.240
She told me about her little sister,

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:10.370
and I told her of my journey.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:13.540
Saya looked so fragile

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.240
and helpless...

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:22.040
I felt like I was looking at my past self.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.580
Six months have passed since then.

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:44.740
I'm now in a country far from the Land of Mages.

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:48.540
Examinee who successfully passed
the apprentice witch exams...

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:54.910
The article wrote about her days
of anguish and her hopes for the future.

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:56.450
About her little sister,

00:21:56.450 --> 00:22:01.290
about how she met a traveler and received
courage to fight alone and a hat,

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:04.160
and how she finally became an apprentice witch.

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:05.790
And--

00:22:05.790 --> 00:22:07.950
When I become a full witch,

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:11.040
I'm going to go see the traveler that I love!

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:18.700
I'm waiting patiently for you
as I continue on my journey, Saya.
